  "answer": "Cannot tell whether the ban changed burning. What the record shows is that detected burning did not fall after 2004: the August to October total averaged 916 in 2001 to 2003 and 1,804 in 2005 to 2011, +97% (+62% to +137%). The rise had started before the ban, there are only three seasons before it, and one of them is Terra alone. The seasons since 2018 are back near the level of before the ban (-4%, -13% to +6%). MODIS night detections are too few to show a move between day and night.",
